  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></math> be two real numbers such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></math> lies on the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now squaring both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>28</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Taking positive sign we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Now taking negative sign we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Note- Official answer key was drop by NTA, here we have modified the option.</p>",
